{"3978410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CHROMACORE", "steam_appid": 3978410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am 4DM1N-D2, your test coordinator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Test Facility 003, the world's bleeding-edge super soldier training ground, and face hordes of enemies to push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHROMACORE is an arena shooter with colour-matching mechanics that will test your visual acuity and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a neon-plagued world, CHROMACORE takes inspiration from classics such as Tron and immerses you in a frenzy of vibrant colours and dystopian machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.poster.avif?t=1758541156\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.webm?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.mp4?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL, ADAPT, SURVIVE, RESPAWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies by matching the colour of your bullets with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new challenges and trigger powerful abilities by defeating enemies in a specific Sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive wave after wave of murderous robots, each with their own movement pattern and attack style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respawn and gain permanent stats based on your performance to help you in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.poster.avif?t=1758541156\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.webm?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.mp4?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you survive to the end?</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am 4DM1N-D2, your test coordinator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Test Facility 003, the world's bleeding-edge super soldier training ground, and face hordes of enemies to push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CHROMACORE is an arena shooter with colour-matching mechanics that will test your visual acuity and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a neon-plagued world, CHROMACORE takes inspiration from classics such as Tron and immerses you in a frenzy of vibrant colours and dystopian machinery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.poster.avif?t=1758541156\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.webm?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/07b537ae64d6141dc2c992f5d52773d3.mp4?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KILL, ADAPT, SURVIVE, RESPAWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill enemies by matching the colour of your bullets with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to new challenges and trigger powerful abilities by defeating enemies in a specific Sequence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive wave after wave of murderous robots, each with their own movement pattern and attack style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respawn and gain permanent stats based on your performance to help you in your next attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.poster.avif?t=1758541156\" width=1170 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.webm?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/extras/54af17e97a8f1ba36c282c0c798bdfd8.mp4?t=1758541156\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you survive to the end?</i></p>", "short_description": "CHROMACORE is a top-down arena shooter set in a futuristic super soldier training facility. Match your neon lights to the enemies in flow-inducing combat. Your task is simple: kill, adapt, survive, respawn.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/78555907a288cdc774c1963601d6c56b5fdaf0e8/header.jpg?t=1758541156", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978410/8